(text "Converter core only - source qualification, cell monitor/balancer and protection are separate." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60f5570a-a7c7-5ff5-bacd-9a2d4f5c2349"))
(text "CE_N pulled high: default charge OFF. OTG tied low. VSET floating: nominal 8.4V.\n250mA is a proposed bench setting; LW charge limits and cell pinout remain unverified.\nNo traction load on SYS_INTERNAL. Do not connect raw LW battery to this unfinished assembly.\nR108 configures local DCP detection. J101 is POWER ONLY; source permission comes from the external gate." (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "881b22df-b4c8-5b98-8aea-dbb0449d7da6"))
(text "C104/C105: >=44uF effective total at operating voltage. Nominal values are placeholders for MPN selection.\nGround: short analog returns and power-pad star per TI; high-current loops require PCB review.\nFlags describe power connectivity for ERC; they do not implement source checks or reverse protection." (at 25.4 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f549e7de-6f05-5fae-94b9-3a4c41884d35"))
